  "title": "Personalized Speckled Classroom Decor Door Mat, Non-Slip Backing",
  "handle": "personalized-speckled-classroom-decor-door-mat-non-slip-backing",
  "description": "<p>This personalized doormat offers a welcoming touch for any classroom or entryway. Designed with a modern aesthetic, it combines personalized charm with functional features to enhance various spaces. Its durable construction is suitable for everyday use.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalize with a teacher's name for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>Features a soft, non-woven fabric top for comfort.</li>\n<li>Equipped with a neoprene rubber non-slip backing for stability.</li>\n<li>Effectively traps dirt, dust, and grime to help keep floors clean.</li>\n<li>Versatile for both indoor and outdoor settings.</li>\n<li>Washable and easy to maintain for lasting freshness.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Classroom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Personalized</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Composition Notebook Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Classroom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Surface/Feel</td>\n<td>Soft non-woven fabric</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Avoid bleaching</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Hose down or sponge clean with mild liquid soap</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Drying</td>\n<td>Air dry</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This doormat is suitable for classroom entrances, teacher spaces, and reading corners. Its durable design also makes it appropriate for entryways and RVs, offering a functional and decorative accent in various settings.</p>",
